  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are borne aloft on gusts and puffs of air.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Wings of Air<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add 10 feet to your fly speed, plus an additional 10 feet times your mythic tier. If you are affected by an effect with the air or electricity descriptor, you can expend one use of mythic power as an immediate action to gain spell resistance of 15 plus your mythic tier against such effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
